1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,049
Ever liked an app, but wished it looked different?

2
00:00:03,049 --> 00:00:04,888
Or worked more like you do?

3
00:00:06,067 --> 00:00:11,964
Fluid lets apps built for it keep their data and useful features, while you choose the experience.

4
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:14,235
Take your tasks.

5
00:00:14,235 --> 00:00:18,174
View them as a list, a board, or one thing at a time.

6
00:00:19,358 --> 00:00:22,403
Change the view, and your work stays right there.

7
00:00:22,403 --> 00:00:23,583
No starting over.

8
00:00:23,583 --> 00:00:26,006
No copying everything into a new app.

9
00:00:27,192 --> 00:00:29,808
You can also ask your AI assistant:

10
00:00:29,808 --> 00:00:34,438
make this simpler, use bigger text, or show only what matters to me.

11
00:00:35,608 --> 00:00:39,073
The assistant can build a different interface using the same app.

12
00:00:39,073 --> 00:00:41,363
You review it and choose its access.

13
00:00:42,525 --> 00:00:44,240
Just want the information?

14
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:49,526
A connected assistant can work with the data directly, without using the app's screens.

15
00:00:50,692 --> 00:00:53,455
You decide what it can read or change.

16
00:00:53,455 --> 00:00:57,160
See the available tools, and turn access off whenever you want.

17
00:00:58,317 --> 00:01:01,680
Fluid is the shared set of rules that makes this possible.

18
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:02,478
Your app.

19
00:01:02,478 --> 00:01:03,276
Your data.

20
00:01:03,276 --> 00:01:04,074
Your way.
